mc('q09','coding','Which predicted protein effect predominates in both groups?',['Truncation','Frameshift','Substitution','Experimentally validated loss of function'],2,'Substitutions predominate. Truncations and frameshifts are smaller categories; experimental validation is not reported.','§3.2.3','Recall')
