mc('q13','coding','Which amino-acid categories lead ALL and AML respectively?',['Glycine-to-arginine and proline-to-leucine','Proline-to-leucine and glycine-to-arginine','Alanine-to-valine and alanine-to-threonine','The manuscript gives no categories'],1,'The reported ALL leader is proline-to-leucine, while AML is glycine-to-arginine. These are pooled categories, not proof of gene-specific recurrence.','§3.2.4','Recall')
