mc('q15','annotation','The 2,487 reference gene features represent what?',['Variant-bearing genes','Expressed transcripts','The reference annotation layer','Pathogenic alleles'],2,'They are reference-derived genomic features. They are not counts of altered genes, expression measurements or pathogenic alleles.','§3.2.1')
